    "title": "Acting Brazos County Judge Kyle Kacal announces run for permanent position - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Karley Cross ,\n4 hours ago BRYAN, Texas (KBTX) - Brazos County Judge Duane Peters announced on Monday that he would not be seeking reelection after finishing his term next year. On Wednesday, Acting County Judge Kyle Kacal told KBTX he would be filing to run. Kacal joined KBTX for an update on all things Brazos... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
